00:51:45,882 --> 00:51:51,882
Dear God is a 1996 American comedy film directed by Garry
Marshall and starring Greg Kinnear and Laurie Metcalf.

12
00:56:28,235 --> 00:56:34,235
Kinnear stars as Tom Turner, a con artist who gets a job at the dead letter office of a
post office, and finds his life changing after reading letters sent to God.

13
01:01:10,588 --> 01:01:16,588
The song of the same title by Midge Ure was used in the
film's theatrical trailer and in the film itself.

14
01:05:52,941 --> 01:05:58,941
Dear God was released by Paramount Pictures on November 1,
1996 to mostly negative reviews from critics.

15
01:10:35,294 --> 01:10:41,294
The film was a box office bomb, grossing
$7,138,523 against a $22 million budget.

16
01:15:17,647 --> 01:15:23,647
The tone is emotional.
